## Twenty minutes from the sea to the woods

The Zuid-Kennemerland national park starts where the town stops. The paths are flat, well marked, and quiet on weekday mornings. Look for the Highland cattle and the fallow deer near the Vogelmeer.

We keep bikes for guests. Reserve one at reception and we will have it ready with a map of the loop.
